BT 1 0 0 1 0 279.804 Tm .113333 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: No. The company is not a public service and is not subject to regulation, so the complaint that) Tj T* 0 Tw (it sells electricity without a franchise must be dismissed for lack of jurisdiction.) Tj  T* 1.8064 Tw (Under C.A. No. 146 Sec. 13\(b\) as amended, a public service must own, operate, manage, or) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.108923 Tw (control a covered service in the Philippines for hire or compensation for general business) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.2048 Tw (purposes, as applied in Cruz de Syquia v. Board of Power and Water Works \(G.R. Nos.) Tj T* 0 Tw .132923 Tw (L-42783-85, November 29, 1976\) where the Court held that a building administrator who merely) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.624615 Tw (advanced the compound-wide Meralco bill and recovered pro rata shares owned no plant and) Tj T* 0 Tw (sold no electricity.) Tj  T* 1.083692 Tw (Here, the company owns no power plant, merely advances the building-wide Meralco bill, and) Tj T* 0 Tw .892615 Tw (collects each tenant's metered share while Meralco supplies electricity directly to the tenants as) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.0304 Tw (end users. The counter-reading that any collection for electricity is a sale for hire fails because) Tj T* 0 Tw .936857 Tw (there is no ownership, operation, management, or control of an electric service and no separate) Tj T* 0 Tw (business of supplying power, only reimbursement of an advanced payment.) Tj  T* 2.852727 Tw (Therefore the company stays outside regulatory jurisdiction, the regulator must dismiss the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.2345 Tw (complaint, and any dispute over the pro rata sharing is a purely civil lease controversy for the) Tj T* 0 Tw (regular courts to decide.) Tj T* ET
